{"url": "https://api.github.com/search/issues?q=repo%3Awithastro/astro%20type%3Apr%20updated%3A2025-08-23..2026-08-23&per_page=1", "ts": "2026-11-20T15:35:10.471708+00:00", "body": {"total_count": 2543, "incomplete_results": false, "items": [{"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro/issues/17799", "repository_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro", "labels_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro/issues/17799/labels{/name}", "comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro/issues/17799/comments", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro/issues/17799/events", "html_url": "https://github.com/withastro/astro/pull/17799", "id": 5223288159, "node_id": "PR_kwDOFL76Q88AAAABAqR33Q", "number": 17799, "title": "Fix i18n fallback rewrite returning 500 instead of 404 for missing prerendered rest-param routes", "user": {"login": "astro-factory[bot]", "id": 316791938, "node_id": "BOT_kgDOEuHcgg", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/44914786?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/astro-factory%5Bbot%5D", "html_url": "https://github.com/apps/astro-factory", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/astro-factory%5Bbot%5D/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/astro-factory%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/astro-factory%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/astro-factory%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/astro-factory%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/astro-factory%5Bbot%5D/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/astro-factory%5Bbot%5D/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/astro-factory%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/astro-factory%5Bbot%5D/received_events", "type": "Bot", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "labels": [{"id": 3559105225, "node_id": "LA_kwDOFL76Q87UI6LJ", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro/labels/pkg:%20astro", "name": "pkg: astro", "color": "b4a8d1", "default": false, "description": "Related to the core `astro` package (scope)", "archived_at": null, "archived_by": null}, {"id": 10953064681, "node_id": "LA_kwDOFL76Q88AAAACjNqA6Q", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro/labels/fix%20verified", "name": "fix verified", "color": "0e8a16", "default": false, "description": "Reporter confirmed the triage bot fix works", "archived_at": null, "archived_by": null}], "state": "closed", "locked": false, "assignees": [], "milestone": null, "comments": 2, "created_at": "2026-08-22T18:16:06Z", "updated_at": "2026-08-23T10:12:13Z", "closed_at": "2026-08-23T10:12:11Z", "assignee": null, "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR", "issue_field_values": [], "type": null, "active_lock_reason": null, "draft": false, "pull_request": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro/pulls/17799", "html_url": "https://github.com/withastro/astro/pull/17799", "diff_url": "https://github.com/withastro/astro/pull/17799.diff", "patch_url": "https://github.com/withastro/astro/pull/17799.patch", "merged_at": "2026-08-23T10:12:11Z"}, "body": "## Summary\n\nWhen `i18n.routing.fallbackType: \"rewrite\"` is configured and a locale-prefixed URL hits a 404 (e.g. a slug excluded from `getStaticPaths()` in all locales), the i18n fallback logic rewrites to the default locale's URL. In server mode, prerendered route components are not bundled into the server entry (`pageMap` only contains SSR routes), so `getModuleForRoute` was throwing `\"Unexpectedly unable to find a component instance\"` \u2014 producing a 500 instead of the expected 404.\n\n## Fix\n\nWraps the `state.rewrite()` call in the `case 'rewrite':` branch of `finalizeI18n` (`packages/astro/src/core/i18n/handler.ts`) with a try/catch. When the rewrite target has no renderable page (i.e. the slug also doesn't exist in the fallback locale), the catch breaks out of the switch and returns the original 404 response. This matches the existing behavior of `fallbackType: \"redirect\"` mode.\n\n## Confirmation\n\nReporter @vdaluz confirmed the fix works on their minimal reproduction repo.\n\nCloses #17778", "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro/issues/17799/reactions", "total_count": 0, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "timeline_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro/issues/17799/timeline", "performed_via_github_app": null, "state_reason": null, "score": 1.0}], "search_type": "lexical"}}